      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `abcfa0cf6f6b79dff5aaa66e068de2356d4bef182a8e7002f275f4c4e1a434b4--45130do005_200708.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Criminal Courts, Australia (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2007-08\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 15 of 15\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | 618542e5535676ba973d8b046789ec61e2ce14c7a269891475a0b94725841026 | missing |\n| \"Table_1\" | 0fe74307996212f3eff7937b4de242aa8486abb17c85c0779b53ad7d33eea126 | missing |\n| \"Table_2\" | b75b9d7b7dbecb0e12ed3bcb9bf84bf7ca1e24ec056ba524ad1495ba1e548db8 | missing |\n| \"Table_3\" | f5f1ff4b2b5f5a6bcffc48084f107b64cc5283bf97dac9dab8a6144070579a8e | missing |\n| \"Table_4\" | 3976be22ccc4de183d0ede01fd7dccf8f9b6518568b160f7b086fe019183d723 | missing |\n| \"Table_5\" | 109f05a0287b7b4d8f7492b1b384fe39522aed2ce220146b56a806c494cf1e0d | missing |\n| \"Table_6\" | b90ac54657c3824c5380f9aa78ef926a74f5cd717c6d1f5ed5f25f1f103f0a17 | missing |\n| \"Table_7\" | 752feef03c6e2926634116446918fbba883baf554e07afa905a836683b95ff70 | missing |\n| \"Table_8\" | 50bccdda45acaf36dc9e64276568636eee3ad73c319aebcbfe22b16c5c33fa80 | missing |\n| \"Table_9\" | 3b44a4d9f7ffb7f8496218158ffc72410d05d7583686db02a130bcab3d00c3e4 | missing |\n| \"Table_10\" | 7e57216bd6dd5426e12b4813c60e7e6a531d60bb9d1654dbe08cfbf7b4ec3455 | missing |\n| \"Table_11\" | 76b9a031c1375ec9f1c2b0d4063dcb95bdf080f0cf608eb4e2c512da647bec51 | missing |\n| \"Table_12\" | ae6bf9bcafb5c827060b500f371519432320cc3b181159a3091686c93aaf4360 | missing |\n| \"Table_13\" | 8fa8e5a4ce96eb67755d7d9271e5d2db41bb9002f34c5e4ad775ab5b5af5df75 | missing |\n| \"Table_14\" | aa266b304f81569a2ea612a5816f8ac2417ce1598d451105f3d35d91581ec585 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and che